w]该怎么说呢……[r][l]如果是以前，碰到这种一听就很危险的事情，我大概想都不想就会拒绝了吧……[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_66"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara3","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":700,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":0,"scaleX":0.9,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":67,"y":-215,"transTime":0,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara001_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]那现在呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_67"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara3","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":700,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":0,"scaleX":0.9,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":67,"y":-215,"transTime":0,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara001_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]现在？现在我也很想拒绝！[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_68"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我呀……虽然多少有些武艺，但也不敢说自己有多厉害。[r][l]在这个荒原上，不要说生活了，光是生存就已经很不容易了，[r][l]怎么可能自找没趣地去靠近那些危险！[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_69"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]所以我真的很不想去什么迷宫啦、遗迹啦这一类危险的地方！但是……[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_70"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara3","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":700,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":0,"scaleX"