尔","text":"[show]嗯！我也是这么想的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_75"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]深渊真是一个奇妙的地方，来到这里才不过几天时间，我就已经遇上了数不清的谜团。[r][l]我的好奇心一直在催促我，想让我去把它们一一解开。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_76"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]而在这之中，我最想知道的是，到底是什么东西，在把我和米托拉联系起来。[r][l]或许我和米托拉的相遇并不是偶然……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_77"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"x":10,"y":0,"d":0.8,"layer":"chara3"},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara3","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":700,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":0,"scaleX":0.9,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":67,"y":-215,"transTime":0,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara001_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]什……什么啊！你是在说我们这是什么“命运的相遇”吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_78"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara3","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":700,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":0,"scaleX":0.9,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"layer":"chara1","nonStandBright":false,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":67,"y":-215,"transTime":0,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"mirrow":false,"trans":false,"img":"chara001_0"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]毕竟我们都发生了那种奇怪的共鸣了，就算是也不奇怪吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_79"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","y":10,"d":0.8,"x":0},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"